2. SITE CONTENT AND ASSETS (LIMITED USE)
================================================================================

Site Content is owned by Michigan Players Golf Club (Principal: Ryan Yip) and
includes everything not listed as FlexNet Architecture Code above, including but
not limited to:

  - Michigan Players Golf Club and Great Lakes Amateur names, logos, and marks
  - Tournament copy, schedules, prizes, sponsorship tiers, and contact details
  - Images and media under assets/, including sponsor and partner marks
  - View fragment markup and text under public/views/
  - Inline page content in index.html (for example the home hero shell)
  - Legacy redirect shells (contact.html, event-details.html, and related files)
  - Site-specific values inside src/core/site-config.js
  - SEO metadata, JSON-LD, robots.txt, sitemap.xml, and social preview assets
    tied to michiganplayersgolfclub.com
  - Testimonials, quotes, and third-party marks reproduced as part of the site

Site Content is provided as part of this example site only.

You MAY:

  - View and study Site Content while learning FlexNet Architecture Code
  - Keep Site Content unchanged while working locally on a private fork

You MAY NOT, without separate written permission from Michigan Players Golf
Club (Principal: Ryan Yip):

  - Reuse Site Content in another public website, product, or marketing material
  - Use Michigan Players Golf Club or Great Lakes Amateur branding, logos, or
    tournament copy for any other project
  - Redistribute Site Content as stock assets, templates, or downloadable packs
  - Imply endorsement, sponsorship, or official affiliation with Michigan
    Players Golf Club or the Great Lakes Amateur except as authorized in writing


